  "Sin transiciones no hay pulsos de fase: el VCO sigue oscilando con la tensión que conserva el filtro. Una BER cero no confirma el enganche.": "Without transitions there are no phase pulses: the VCO keeps running at the voltage held by the filter. Zero BER does not confirm lock.",
